        <mxCell id="novpc" value="&lt;div style=&quot;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.42&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;color:#1A5276&quot;&gt;No VPC in this design&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;S3 and CloudFront are managed services reached through AWS public endpoints: no subnets, security groups or NAT.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;The default VPC enters later, with the ALB and the ECS Fargate game server.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=fill;rounded=0;strokeColor=#C5CCD3;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="cloud">
