        <mxCell id="p-cf" value="&lt;div style=&quot;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;padding:8px 10px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:6px&quot;&gt;CloudFront distribution&lt;/div&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;background:#232F3E;color:#FFFFFF;text-align:left;padding:4px 6px;border:1px solid #232F3E;width:36%;&quot;&gt;Setting&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;background:#232F3E;color:#FFFFFF;text-align:left;padding:4px 6px;border:1px solid #232F3E;width:64%;&quot;&gt;Value&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Origin&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;S3 bucket through Origin Access Control (SigV4)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Viewer protocol&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;redirect-to-https&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Certificate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Default *.cloudfront.net (no custom domain)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Default root object&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;index.html&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cache&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;Managed CachingOptimized + invalidation per deploy&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Price class&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;PriceClass_100 (parameter)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Protocols&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;HTTP/2, HTTP/3 · IPv6 on&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=fill;rounded=0;strokeColor=#C5CCD3;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="653" y="960" width="593" height="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p-tf" value="&lt;div style=&quot;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;padding:8px 10px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:6px&quot;&gt;Terraform contract (module static-site)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;background:#232F3E;color:#FFFFFF;text-align:left;padding:4px 6px;border:1px solid #232F3E;width:22%;&quot;&gt;Kind&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&quot;background:#232F3E;color:#FFFFFF;text-align:left;padding:4px 6px;border:1px solid #232F3E;width:78%;&quot;&gt;Names&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inputs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;project, environment, aws_region (eu-west-1), price_class, enable_versioning, force_destroy, default_root_object, tags&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Outputs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;bucket_name, bucket_arn, distribution_id, distribution_domain_name, url&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Backend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;S3, partial config per environment (backend.hcl), use_lockfile&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tags&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 6px;border:1px solid #C5CCD3;vertical-align:top;&quot;&gt;default_tags: Project, Environment, ManagedBy = terraform&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=fill;rounded=0;strokeColor=#C5CCD3;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1267" y="960" width="593" height="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ex-title" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;Design notes&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1250" width="600" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ex-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.42&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;color:#1A5276&quot;&gt;1. A private bucket with one front door&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;The bucket is never public. Block Public Access and disabled ACLs leave the bucket policy as the only way in.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;That policy trusts the CloudFront service only for &lt;b&gt;this&lt;/b&gt; distribution (AWS:SourceArn), so no other distribution, in any account, can be pointed at the bucket.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=fill;rounded=0;strokeColor=#C5CCD3;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1292" width="593" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ex-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.42&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;color:#1A5276&quot;&gt;2. Brotli files need the right headers&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;Unity ships the build already compressed. CloudFront does not re-compress responses that carry Content-Encoding, so every object is uploaded with &lt;b&gt;Content-Encoding: br&lt;/b&gt; and its real Content-Type.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;Without them the browser cannot decode the files and the game does not load.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=fill;rounded=0;strokeColor=#C5CCD3;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="653" y="1292" width="593" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ex-3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;padding:10px 14px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.42&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;color:#1A5276&quot;&gt;3. Terraform provisions, a script releases&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;Infrastructure changes rarely and goes through a reviewed plan. Builds change every release.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:7px&quot;&gt;Terraform owns the bucket, policy, OAC and distribution; the deploy script uploads files and invalidates the cache, reading only Terraform outputs. Build artifacts never enter Terraform state.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=fill;rounded=0;strokeColor=#C5CCD3;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1267" y="1292" width="593" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>